    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew. Manage. Unwind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the serene art of hospitality in <strong>Beer Onsen Resort</strong>, a one\u2010of\u2010a\u2010kind business simulation where you brew beer to infuse into hot springs to serve spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where bubbling hot springs meet artisanal beer, and wandering spirits seek solace in flavors as much as warmth. As the new Brew Master &amp; Resort Manager, you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew Innovative Beer Blends</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hops, grains, spices\u2014and even mystical botanicals\u2014to craft signature elixirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse each blend directly into your hot springs, customizing aroma, color, and potency to delight every spectral guest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Master Recipes</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover age-old classics from across the spirit realm, as well as playful, offbeat concoctions like Tropical Storm IPA and Wild Grape Lager.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace Emergent, Chill Gameplay</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch spirits react uniquely: some crave bold flavors, others subtle notes\u2014learn their preferences and watch words spread through the misty land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Brewing System</strong> Intuitive drag-and-drop interface meets layered crafting\u2014every tweak to your recipe yields measurable changes in guest satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Economy</strong> Each spirit has a story and a palate\u2014cater to their tastes for tips, special orders, or rare ingredients as rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Light Management</strong> Casual but engaging: streamline workflows, automate repetitive tasks, or dive deep into fine-tuning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Soundscape &amp; Art Style</strong> A lush, hand-crafted world, accompanied by a calming soundtrack that evolves with your resort\u2019s growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to craft the ultimate haven for weary souls?</strong> Build your legacy\u2014one brew, one soak, and one satisfied spirit at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew. Manage. Unwind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the serene art of hospitality in <strong>Beer Onsen Resort</strong>, a one\u2010of\u2010a\u2010kind business simulation where you brew beer to infuse into hot springs to serve spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where bubbling hot springs meet artisanal beer, and wandering spirits seek solace in flavors as much as warmth. As the new Brew Master &amp; Resort Manager, you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew Innovative Beer Blends</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/a33c78b98c9ac5cd91b8cee53bd5811c.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hops, grains, spices\u2014and even mystical botanicals\u2014to craft signature elixirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse each blend directly into your hot springs, customizing aroma, color, and potency to delight every spectral guest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Master Recipes</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/2b6bb61e74b2647c3a494e35b3e7a8b1.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover age-old classics from across the spirit realm, as well as playful, offbeat concoctions like Tropical Storm IPA and Wild Grape Lager.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace Emergent, Chill Gameplay</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/241de119d561701ce1bf24e6aedb4530.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.poster.avif?t=1750047701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.webm?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683800/extras/1071bd5d379a0a8377526f721fbf2544.mp4?t=1750047701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch spirits react uniquely: some crave bold flavors, others subtle notes\u2014learn their preferences and watch words spread through the misty land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Brewing System</strong> Intuitive drag-and-drop interface meets layered crafting\u2014every tweak to your recipe yields measurable changes in guest satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Economy</strong> Each spirit has a story and a palate\u2014cater to their tastes for tips, special orders, or rare ingredients as rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Light Management</strong> Casual but engaging: streamline workflows, automate repetitive tasks, or dive deep into fine-tuning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Soundscape &amp; Art Style</strong> A lush, hand-crafted world, accompanied by a calming soundtrack that evolves with your resort\u2019s growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to craft the ultimate haven for weary souls?</strong> Build your legacy\u2014one brew, one soak, and one satisfied spirit at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Beer Onsen Resort! As both Brew Master and Resort Manager, you\u2019ll concoct extraordinary brews, infuse them into steaming hot springs, and pamper wandering spirits from every corner. Rack up gold, unlock arcane recipes, and turn this retreat into the spirit realm\u2019s hottest getaway!",
